Here is the Markdown table converted into a properly normalized JSON array. 

The sub-columns are structured as nested objects or combined keys to ensure each data point is correctly attributed to both its parent quarter (Q1, Q2) and its sub-category (Sales, Cost).

```json
[
  {
    "Name": "Alice",
    "Q1": {
      "Sales": 100,
      "Cost": 40
    },
    "Q2": {
      "Sales": 120,
      "Cost": 45
    }
  }
]
```
